            "sid": "JOS 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.20+NUM.32.21+NUM.32.22+NUM.32.23+NUM.32.24+NUM.32.25+NUM.32.26+NUM.32.27+NUM.32.28+NUM.32.29+NUM.32.30+NUM.32.31+NUM.32.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 32.20-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh. 1.12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ababoolela ali, “Mwakholile buli siindu nisio Musa omukholi owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aamuboolela khukhola, lundi mwariire kamalaka kaase koosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biise bino bioosi mukhalobakho Baisiraeli basienywe tawe. Mwabeele barekerefu mu khuria kamalaka ka Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, aelesie Baisiraeli basienywe kumuleembe nga aabalaka. Khwako kobola engo niio kamaloba ke kumukabwa kwenywe kali, kamaloba kali elubeka luluundi lwa Yoritani niko Musa omukholi owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aamuelesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhoya murie lilaka nilio Musa amuelesia. Siima Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe, khola lilienya liewe, ria kamalaka kewe, ba babeyikinwa khu niye mala mu mukholele niye kimilimo ne kumwoyo kwenywe kwoosi, ne liba lienywe lioosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yoshua ababiita chikhabi mala abasibula bache engo. Ababoolela ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mulikho muloota engo ne muli baiinda lukali, ne bubayi bukali, chifwesa, chisahabu ne kimikasa, ne bichuuma, ne chingubo chingali lukali. Kabana ne babaasienywe nibio mubukuule khukhwama khu basiku benywe.” Nio bacha engo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aaba aaelesia kamaloba ke ebukwe owa Yoritani, khu kholo eya Manase, ndalakho ne Yoshua aelesia ekholo eyasikala kamaloba ke mumbo mwa Yoritani, alala ne chikholo chichiindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono babaandu Be Chikholo cha Rubeni, Kati, nende be bukwe mwa Manase bakobola engo. Balekha Baisiraeli babaandi e Shilo mu maloba ka Kanaani mala bacha mu maloba kabwe kameene ka Kileati. Kamaloba ako niko babukula nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne abalaka khubirira khu Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Alutare khu Yoritani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga chikholo cha Rubeni, Kati, nende balala khu be kholo eya Manase, ne choola Keliloti lubeka lwe mumbo mwa Yoritani, chombakha alutare emboofu ambi ne luluuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisiraeli babolelwa bali, “Lola! Be owa Rubeni Kati ne balala khu be owa Manase bombakhe khu ndulo alutare a Keliloti e Yoritani khu lubeka luli ambi ne nafwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne, nga Baisiraeli ne baulila kano, babusiana e Shilo, khu khuupana ne chikholo che Bukwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Baisiraeli baruma Fineasi okhwa Eliesa omusaayi khu be owa Rubeni, be owa Kati ne khu be owa Manase eye Bukwe mu maloba ka Kileati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fineasi acha ne babemeelesi ekhumi, mulala khukhwama buli mu kholo che mumbo ne buli mulala omwimeelesi owe luuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio becha khu be owa Rubeni, be owa Kati, nende be owa Manase, mu maloba ka Kileati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.13+DEU.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 12.13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mala bababoolela bali libuusiana lioosi lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi liloma lili, “Siina sikila ne mukholile bumayaanu khu Wele owa Isiraeli! Mwarurire khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nga mweyombakhiile alutare. Se musimuloonda lundi tawe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 25.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bubwoni nibwo khwakhola e Peori sebwolaana ta ku? Se mubona muli khusili khukhwitakaasa mala kumunaanio kwabwo kusiinania babaandu bo Mwami Wele Omunyali owa Bioosi ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulikho mucha khuloba khumuloonda nono? Mwaba ne murura khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi luno, acha khuba ne lirima khu buli mulala mu Isiraeli kumutikhinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, aba kamaloba kenywe ne kakhali kamalayi ke khukhwisaayilamo tawe, khe mwiche eno mu maloba ka Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, niio Liiema liewe lili. Khe mukhusabe kamaloba kakaandi mwifwe. Ne mukharura khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi namwe mukhole efwe khumururekho ne mwombakha alutare khutasa khu alutare eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wefwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.1+JOS.7.2+JOS.7.3+JOS.7.4+JOS.7.5+JOS.7.6+JOS.7.7+JOS.7.8+JOS.7.9+JOS.7.10+JOS.7.11+JOS.7.12+JOS.7.13+JOS.7.14+JOS.7.15+JOS.7.16+JOS.7.17+JOS.7.18+JOS.7.19+JOS.7.20+JOS.7.21+JOS.7.22+JOS.7.23+JOS.7.24+JOS.7.25+JOS.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh. 7.1-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khebulila nga nilwo Akani okhwa Sera aaloba khuria lilaka khu biindu bitakatifu, mala Baisiraeli boosi banyolelakho kumunaanio. Ne Akani se aafwa yeng'ene sikila bumayaanu bwewe tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio be owa Rubeni, be owa Kati, nende be owa Manase babakobosia ne khuboolela babemeelesi be chinju cha Isiraeli bali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omunyali ali Wele! Ali Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi! Omunyali ali Wele! Ali Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi! Amanyile sikila ne khwakhola lino, ne lekha Baisiraeli boosi bamanye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwaaba bali se khwarire Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe mala khwombakhe alutare yefwe busa niio khuanilemo biianwa bie embosio, namwe bie biakhulia namwe bie kumuleembe, lekha Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhue efwe kumunaanio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tawe! Khwakhola khurio sikila khwaba ne buuri khuli mu siise sisiicha babaana benywe banyala bareeba babaana befwe bali, ‘Enywe muli na siina khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi owa Isiraeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhola Yoritani khuba lulwakha akari wefwe ne nanywe, babaandu ba Rubeni ne Kati. Se mulikho ne sitonyi siosi siosi khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe.’ Nono babaana benywe banyala bakhola babaana befwe balekha khusaaya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono khwaloma khuli, khakhwombakhe alutare, ne se elaba eye khukhwoseliakho biianwa namwe chimbosio tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali sibe simanyisio khwifwe ne nanywe, ne chiselukho chefwe chichiicha enyuma wefwe, mbo ng'ali khusaayanga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mu liiema liewe khubirira mu biianwa biefwe bie khukhwosia, ne chimbosio ne biianwa bie kumuleembe. Se khwenya lisaaye lienywe lilomele liliefwe mu bise bibiicha lili, ‘Enywe se mulikho ne sitonyi khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khwebaasia khuli, lino liaba ne lilomekha khwifwe namwe khu lisaaye liefwe munyanga chichiicha khunyala khwaloma khuli, ‘Lola! Bakuuka befwe bakhola alutare bulayi bwene nga eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Se yaba eye chimbosio tawe, ne kakhali eli simanyisio khu baandu befwe ne babenywe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se khwalekhilekho Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe, namwe se khwalekhile khumuloonda nio khwombakhe alutare khulwe biianwa bie khukhwosia nende bie biakhulia namwe embosio tawe. Se khunyala khwombakha alutare ekiindi ne ekhali alutare eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wefwe eli ebweeni we liiema liewe tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga omusaayi Fineasi ne bakasa ekhumi nende be kumukaanda bakhulu be chinju cha Isiraeli ba baaba ne naye, ne baulila kamakhuwa niko be owa Rubeni nende be owa Kati nende be owa Manase balomaloma, kabasiimisia lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Fineasi, okhwa Eliesa omusaayi, aboolela be owa Rubeni, Kati, nende be owa Manase ali, “Luno khwamanyile khuli Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ali nafwe. Sikila enywe semwamulekhile tawe. Nono mwaoniisie babaandu ba Isiraeli khukhwama mu sinyaasio sia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Fineasi okhwa Eliesa ne babemeelesi balekha be owa Rubeni nende be owa Kati mu maloba ka Kileati, bakobola e Kanaani khu baandu ba Isiraeli, mala bababoolela nga kaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano kasiimisia Baisiraeli mala bafumia Wele. Ne se balomalomakho lundi kamakhuwa ke khucha khusera chikholo che ebukwe namwe khukhwonaka kamaloba niko bamenyamo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be owa Rubeni nende be owa Kati baloma bali, “Alutare yino eli buloli khwifwe fweesi mbo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ali Wele.” Mala bakitiuukha bali “Buloli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
